The integration follows the public documentation of the meteoblue Forecast API
and Image API. No meteoblue code is included. The weather pictograms and the
meteograms are fetched at run time from meteoblue (static.meteoblue.com and
my.meteoblue.com) and are not redistributed; meteoblue offers its pictograms
for free use with a link back to its pictogram page, which the documentation
and the widgets provide. Weather data: meteoblue AG (www.meteoblue.com).

